From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oleksii Kulinich <entaytion@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:37:44 +0300
Subject: Add folder tab customization: indicator stroke, bottom placement, hide archive from chat list

- tab indicator stroke style and hide-archive-from-list ported from NagramXF (FilterTabsView, MessagesController)
- move folder tabs to the bottom of the screen, reusing existing FAB offset fields instead of duplicating NagramXF's scroll-hide bookkeeping (DialogsActivity, FolderHelper, DialogsFabHelper)
- fix actionbar blur height and search field positioning still reserving top space for the tabs bar after it moved to the bottom
- reserve list bottom padding for the bottom-anchored tabs bar so future content cannot render underneath it
---
